    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6b89eb1b284449fd9607f0107972f3d3",
      "statement": "Every asynchronous effect is versioned by an `OpId`; completion events with an obsolete op are ignored by the core's phase checks, and `Failure` distinguishes a `Definite` failure from an `Ambiguous` one that may have committed.",
